WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:22.625
- Ah, yes, The MandaLakeran. 

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:24.958
I’d know that brow anywhere.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.541
- Here is the bounty you requested.

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:29.375
- Excellent. 

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.875
Midseason bounties are quite valuable.

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:33.583
We will add him to the collection.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.208
The freezing process has improved over the years.

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:37.375
Somewhat.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.416
- The Hoth Angeles super team is now complete.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:44.875
- Not quite. There is one more asset I need, from your home planet.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:46.500
- Naboo Orleans?

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:50.291
- Yes, there is a new threat to our empire there, a child. 

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:54.041
As the future of basketball, he belongs in a big market.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.416
Perhaps you should bring the RONDO-9.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.375
- No. The child’s defenders will just sag off the Rondo and double me in the paint.

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:12.166
- I’m here for the Child.

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.958
- Ha. There’s three of us and one of you.

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:17.416
Do you really think you’re as strong as three men?

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.291
- And three draft picks.

00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:22.541
- So long, MandaLakeran.

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:26.791
- Keep shooting like that, they’ll make you a stormtrooper.

00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:35.958
You’re the “future of basketball”?

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.833
I guess you’re gonna move a lot of merch. Well, let’s go.

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.833
We’ve gotta get you below two-seventy.

00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:48.416
- Welcome back to “Space Sports Talk.”

00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:54.083
Our top story: shocking revelations about former NBA great Obi-Wan Wallace.

00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:57.958
- “Obi-Wan Wallace”? I wonder if he means old Ben Wallace.

00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:01.083
Leaving there is for your own good.

00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:05.666
Basketball once flourished everywhere, but that was before the rise of the Super Team.

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:08.500
I was there for the slaughter of my people in the 

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:15.166
2012-2013-2014-2015-2016-2017-2018 and 2019 seasons.

00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:18.791
I had no choice but to flee with eighteen months still on my contract.

00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:20.041
This is the way.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.791
It’s the Duke Blue Devils! They want you back for three more years!

00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:29.166
Hold on, kid.

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:30.416
Kid?

00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:36.958
We lost them! How did you do that?

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:40.583
I’ve never seen a ship cut so hard that it tore apart its own landing gear.

00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:44.500
I guess you are special. 

00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:47.625
Too special for LeBron to banish you to the three-point line

00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:51.000
I can’t take you to him. There’s only one place to go.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.000
There is no more basketball here. You’ll be safe.

00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:01.041
- I wouldn’t count on it.

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:04.500
The RONDO-9 put a tracking device on your ship.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.291
- Damn it. I didn’t search my ship for tropes.

00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:10.583
- Now stand at the three-point line while I talk to the Child.

00:03:11.375 --> 00:03:12.416
- I won’t let you have him.

00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:14.458
- I understand your conflict. 

00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:18.833
I too once felt the pull of small-market guilt and went back to my home planet.

00:03:19.875 --> 00:03:22.708
But all stars belong in Hoth Angeles.

00:03:23.083 --> 00:03:24.458
- We couldn’t agree more.

00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:27.083
We also left small markets. 

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:32.250
But there’s two Super Teams on your planet, LeBron, and we want the Child...

00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:38.166
- Come to the Clippers, my son.

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:39.541
- Here I am, Dad!

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:40.625
- Ew, not you.

00:03:42.125 --> 00:03:44.333
- He should join the Golden Empire.

00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:47.125
- No, mate, he should join The Process.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.125
- Oi, kiddywink, you wanna be part of The Process?

00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:53.291
- The Child isn’t going with any of you.

00:03:53.625 --> 00:03:54.958
- Get out of here, Popovich.

00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:57.541
- No. The Child can succeed anywhere.

00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:01.458
I thrived for decades in the barren deserts of San Antooine

00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:02.333
- Enough!

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.125
For years you tried to sell me on that small-market crap!

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:10.875
- Ow, my thigh! I’m out for five games—maybe a season!

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:13.291
- Run. And take the Child with you.

00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:15.833
- There’s too many of them. We can’t escape.

00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:18.666
- Yes, we can. I’ll coach the RONDO-9.

00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:19.875
- What?

00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:22.875
- If you try to coach a RONDO-9, it self-destructs.

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.083
RONDO-9, play within the offense.

00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:27.250
- Initiating self-destruct.

00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:28.291
- Run!

00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:34.750
- Don’t worry, I’m sure Popovich will come back as a ghost. 

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:37.375
So, kid, where should we go now?

00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:41.666
Home? But you can’t win there.

00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:45.708
- Small market make big, I will.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.583
- I am the real Chris Paul.

00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:05.541
- Man, this guy even follows me into space.

00:05:06.041 --> 00:05:08.583
Don’t fall for mind tricks. You want the real deal, 

00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:10.708
especially when it comes to home and auto insurance.

